  "description": "Dwarfism in a zombie apocalypse.\n\nDuring a zombie apocalypse, five survivors have taken refuge inside an old building. Food is delivered to the rooftop, but the only way up is through a chute too small for the average adult. Seongguk's dwarfism makes him the only candidate, but when he faces backlash, dark ideas begin to stir… \n\n(Source: Manta)",
